# Whitelist: the build context is the whole workspace, so exclude everything and re-include only what is needed.
# This keeps .env (API keys!) and .venv out of the image.
*
!packages/llm-client
!projects/a1-rag-docqa

**/.env
**/.venv
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.cache
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
**/llm_calls.jsonl
projects/a1-rag-docqa/results
projects/a1-rag-docqa/docs
projects/a1-rag-docqa/tests
